Rose (Japanese: ローズ Rose) is the president of the Macro Cosmos conglomerate and the chairman of the Galar Pokémon League. He was the first person to endorse Leon as a , and also sponsored Bede's Gym Challenge. He also designed and developed the metropolis of Wyndon, which houses the headquarters for both the Galar Pokémon League and Macro Cosmos. Like his estranged brother Peony, he uses Pokémon.

